                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "235211638",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561197988663774",
                            "num_reviews": 415,
                            "playtime_forever": 140,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 109,
                            "last_played": 1789326910
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Bad Angry Birds-like game that feels like it was never finished, despite not being in Early Access. There's a Campaign that unlocks more story which I didn't complete because it's just \"do 4 random maps and then get a page of a story\" nine times, so I stopped after doing it once, and four bosses you have to unlock by throwing your level-up talismans at them instead, which unlock new types of bullet.\n\nUnfortunately the biggest problem with Blasted Fortress is there's just basically nothing to the game, once you've done a few stages and one boss fight, you've seen everything there is to have, and the unlockable bullet types aren't very useful at all...\n\nNot recommended.\n\n(Yes I know I didn't finish it. I also spent some time idling for all the cards, so my actual playtime is more like 1 hour flat.)",
